slides.prompt:
Executive title slide featuring a pristine white canvas with bold, high-contrast typography that commands attention. The layout is perfectly balanced with a massive circular image of a dusk-lit city skyline on the right, grounded by deep red geometric accents that add a layer of sophistication and corporate authority. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "HorizontalSplit",
    "ratio": "50/50",
    "padding": "48px",
    "alignment": "center-y"
  },
  "branding": {
    "logo_position": "top-left",
    "logo_icon": "crown",
    "logo_color": "#EE1D23",
    "company_name": "GLOBAL VISION",
    "tagline": "INNOVATING EXCELLENCE"
  },
  "typography": {
    "h1_primary": { "text": "CORPORATE", "color": "#EE1D23", "size": "54px", "weight": "900", "case": "uppercase", "tracking": "-0.05em" },
    "h1_secondary": { "text": "STRATEGY DECK", "color": "#1E1E1E", "size": "54px", "weight": "900", "case": "uppercase", "tracking": "-0.05em" },
    "body": { "size": "11px", "color": "#6B7280", "line_height": "1.6", "max_width": "384px" },
    "footer_tag": { "text": "GLOBAL PARTNER NETWORK 2024", "size": "10px", "color": "#9CA3AF", "weight": "700", "tracking": "0.2em" }
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "accent_bar": { "width": "64px", "height": "4px", "color": "#EE1D23", "margin_bottom": "24px" },
    "main_mask": {
      "shape": "circle",
      "size": "340px",
      "border": "10px solid #FFFFFF",
      "shadow": "0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)",
      "image_mood": "Executive skyline dusk"
    },
    "background_accents": [
      { "shape": "circle", "size": "350px", "color": "#EE1D23", "position": "top-right", "offset": "-10%" },
      { "shape": "circle", "size": "120px", "color": "#1E1E1E", "position": "bottom-center", "offset": "5%" }
    ]
  }
}

A warm and professional welcome slide that builds immediate trust. A large circular portrait of the executive leader is positioned prominently on the left, framed by a vibrant red ring. To the right, a clean vertical stack of text explains the company's core values, set against a minimalist white backdrop with a faint, elegant watermark of a quote icon. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "SidebarLayout",
    "ratio": "40/60",
    "gap": "64px"
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "portrait_mask": {
      "shape": "circle",
      "size": "380px",
      "border": "4px solid #EE1D23",
      "image": "CEO_Headshot_Professional"
    },
    "background_quote_icon": {
      "icon": "quote",
      "size": "200px",
      "color": "#EE1D23",
      "opacity": "0.05",
      "position": "center"
    }
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "text": "WELCOME TO EXCELLENCE", "size": "42px", "weight": "900", "color": "#1E1E1E" },
    "content": { "size": "16px", "color": "#4B5563", "line_height": "1.8", "spacing": "24px" }
  },
  "colors": {
    "background": "#FFFFFF",
    "accent": "#EE1D23"
  }
}

A highly structured three-column grid showcasing the strategic foundation of the business. Each pillar is introduced by a high-contrast icon in red, sitting atop a clean, professional card. The layout emphasizes clarity and modularity, using generous whitespace to allow each key message to breathe. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "ThreeColumnGrid",
    "gap": "32px",
    "padding": "64px"
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "pillar_1",
      "icon": "zap",
      "icon_bg": "#FEE2E2",
      "icon_color": "#EE1D23",
      "title": "Strategic Innovation",
      "description": "Leveraging R&D for market leadership."
    },
    {
      "id": "pillar_2",
      "icon": "shield",
      "icon_bg": "#FEE2E2",
      "icon_color": "#EE1D23",
      "title": "Operational Excellence",
      "description": "Optimized efficiency and zero-waste."
    },
    {
      "id": "pillar_3",
      "icon": "globe",
      "icon_bg": "#FEE2E2",
      "icon_color": "#EE1D23",
      "title": "Global Connectivity",
      "description": "Integrated digital infrastructure."
    }
  ],
  "styling": {
    "title_font": "Bold 24px #1E1E1E",
    "body_font": "Medium 14px #6B7280",
    "alignment": "center"
  }
}

A cinematic timeline slide set against a powerful deep-red gradient. A refined white path flows across the center, connecting glowing nodes that represent key historical milestones. Each node features high-fidelity typography that tells a story of consistent growth and technological evolution. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "HorizontalTimeline",
  "background": "linear-gradient(135deg, #EE1D23 0%, #991B1B 100%)",
  "timeline": {
    "line_color": "#FFFFFF",
    "line_thickness": "2px",
    "node_count": 3,
    "node_style": "white_circle_glow"
  },
  "data_points": [
    { "year": "2020-2021", "event": "Founded & Vision Established", "position": "above" },
    { "year": "2022-2023", "event": "Global Expansion (5 Territories)", "position": "below" },
    { "year": "2024-2025", "event": "Market Leadership & AI Integration", "position": "above" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "year_font": "Bold 22px #FFFFFF",
    "event_font": "Light 13px #FCA5A5"
  }
}

A dynamic comparison slide that balances emotional human imagery with rational list-based benefits. On the left, an organic-shaped image of a collaborative team is softened by a red tint. On the right, a vertical list of unique selling points is clearly defined by bold red icons and professional typography, creating a powerful case for partnership. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "SplitHero",
    "ratio": "60/40",
    "reverse": true
  },
  "visuals": {
    "image_mask": "organic_blob",
    "overlay_color": "rgba(238, 29, 35, 0.1)",
    "image_content": "Collaborative_Success_Team"
  },
  "list_items": [
    { "icon": "check-circle", "title": "Proven Track Record", "desc": "98% Satisfaction" },
    { "icon": "users", "title": "Expert Team", "desc": "100+ Years Experience" },
    { "icon": "clock", "title": "24/7 Support", "desc": "Global Network" },
    { "icon": "trending-up", "title": "Scalable Solutions", "desc": "Enterprise Grade" }
  ],
  "styling": {
    "icon_color": "#EE1D23",
    "item_spacing": "40px",
    "bg_color": "#FFFFFF"
  }
}

A clean and modern service menu utilizing a 2x2 grid of interactive-looking cards. Each quadrant features a minimalist icon and a focused title, with a subtle hover-ready shadow that adds depth to the overall layout. The white-on-grey color scheme ensures high readability and a professional, tech-forward aesthetic. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "2x2Grid",
    "gap": "24px"
  },
  "card_style": {
    "bg": "#FFFFFF",
    "radius": "16px",
    "shadow": "hover:shadow-xl",
    "padding": "32px"
  },
  "services": [
    { "title": "Digital Strategy", "icon": "code" },
    { "title": "Market Research", "icon": "trending-up" },
    { "title": "Growth Hacking", "icon": "users" },
    { "title": "Technical Support", "icon": "settings" }
  ],
  "colors": {
    "icon_color": "#EE1D23",
    "text_color": "#1E1E1E"
  }
}

A professional team showcase slide with a focus on individual identity. Four circular portraits are aligned horizontally, each resting on a sharp red accent bar. The typographic hierarchy beneath each portrait is refined and clean, communicating the depth of experience and unity of the leadership team. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "4ColumnPortraitRow",
  "spacing": "32px",
  "member_card": {
    "image_shape": "circle",
    "image_size": "180px",
    "accent_bar": "4px solid #EE1D23"
  },
  "typography": {
    "name": "Bold 18px #1E1E1E",
    "role": "Uppercase 12px #9CA3AF"
  }
}

A high-density data dashboard designed for fiscal clarity. The slide utilizes a dark, professional background with high-contrast charts in red and white. Metric cards at the bottom provide immediate snapshots of key performance indicators, creating a sense of technical supremacy and data-driven success. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DualChartDashboard",
  "colors": {
    "bg": "#1E1E1E",
    "primary": "#EE1D23",
    "secondary": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "charts": [
    { "type": "Bar", "label": "Revenue Growth", "color": "#EE1D23" },
    { "type": "Line", "label": "Market Projection", "color": "#FFFFFF" }
  ],
  "metrics": [
    { "label": "Growth", "value": "+25%" },
    { "label": "Retention", "value": "98%" },
    { "label": "Margin", "value": "18%" }
  ]
}

A powerful and minimalist closing slide. A giant 'THANK YOU' message sits at the center, anchored by a vibrant red period. Contact information is neatly arranged in a horizontal strip at the bottom, accompanied by clean icons, ensuring a professional and memorable conclusion to the presentation. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CenteredMinimalist",
  "headline": { "text": "THANK YOU", "size": "80px", "color": "#1E1E1E", "accent_dot": "#EE1D23" },
  "contact_strip": {
    "columns": 3,
    "items": [
      { "icon": "mail", "text": "contact@globalstrategy.com" },
      { "icon": "phone", "text": "+1 (800) 555-0199" },
      { "icon": "map-pin", "text": "500 Innovation Plaza, NY" }
    ]
  }
}
